{"id": null, "n": "0735025", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0735025", "type": "orig", "text": "若＝答【宮】，若＋（人）【元】【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0735026", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0735026", "type": "orig", "text": "菩提＋（道）【三】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0736001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0736001", "type": "orig", "text": "（善哉）＋善【元】【明】"}
