{"id": null, "n": "0736021", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0736021", "type": "orig", "text": "震＝振【宋】【元】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0736022", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0736022", "type": "orig", "text": "（佛言…斯義）九百十一字【三】，【宮】大異卷未出之"}
