{"id": null, "n": "0737002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0737002", "type": "orig", "text": "〔我於來世必得此法〕－【三】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0737003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0737003", "type": "orig", "text": "串＝慣【三】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0737004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0737004", "type": "orig", "text": "（我本行…無作故）六百四字【三】【宮】大異卷末出之"}
{"id": null, "n": "0738001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0738001", "type": "orig", "text": "（跋）＋提【元】【明】"}
