{"id": null, "n": "0739001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0739001", "type": "orig", "text": "（佛告…善說）六百十九字【三】【宮】＝本文（佛言…斯義）九百十字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0739002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0739002", "type": "orig", "text": "（我）＋住【元】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0739003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0739003", "type": "orig", "text": "此文（善男子…故）五百二十七字【三】【宮】＝本文（我本行…故）六百四字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0739004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0739004", "type": "orig", "text": "〔若善男子…波羅蜜〕八十一字－【宮】"}
